WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.086 --> 00:00:50.673
<v Signaling Pigeon>[pigeon sound]

2
00:01:05.349 --> 00:01:07.815
<v Stakeholder>I strongly object to this lazy plan to kill us.

3
00:01:08.323 --> 00:01:11.337
<v Stakeholder>Killing us does not have a lasting effect on our population size.

4
00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:14.482
<v Stakeholder>We just rebound quickly because of our high fertility rates.

5
00:01:15.073 --> 00:01:18.403
<v Stakeholder>Why waste our lives on a temporary fix that always fails?
